    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799360/extras/56b892766460319e582dd7b0336e1c0d.poster.avif?t=1755014136\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799360/extras/56b892766460319e582dd7b0336e1c0d.webm?t=1755014136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799360/extras/56b892766460319e582dd7b0336e1c0d.mp4?t=1755014136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>iZolated</strong> is a post-apocalyptic world with procedurally generated locations affected by the Spoils, where in order to survive you have to create food, equipment, weapons and even build your own shelter from improvised items!<br><br>Travel through the procedurally generated forest, get resources, explore new locations, evolve to get out of the forest enveloped by the spoil.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799360/extras/f156c0b88e0724b4f9eaacefb2b88ba2.poster.avif?t=1755014136\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799360/extras/f156c0b88e0724b4f9eaacefb2b88ba2.webm?t=1755014136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799360/extras/f156c0b88e0724b4f9eaacefb2b88ba2.mp4?t=1755014136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Spoilage is a zombie virus that occurred due to scientists' experiments with plants, and this contagion spreads from the forest, infecting all living things with pollen. You will learn about the causes of the disaster and the consequences as you progress through the story of the game, will it lead to the final end for the world or is there a chance to survive?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799360/extras/74ef416e32b6be0dd69ac35f476a7c4a.poster.avif?t=1755014136\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799360/extras/74ef416e32b6be0dd69ac35f476a7c4a.webm?t=1755014136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799360/extras/74ef416e32b6be0dd69ac35f476a7c4a.mp4?t=1755014136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Game Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Character customization.<br></li><li>Semi-procedural world generation.<br></li><li>Weapon upgrades with special modifiers.<br></li><li>Crafting and Resource Extraction through hunting/fishing.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799360/extras/2c8841295fa65b285fb8b477ac7e82ae.poster.avif?t=1755014136\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799360/extras/2c8841295fa65b285fb8b477ac7e82ae.webm?t=1755014136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799360/extras/2c8841295fa65b285fb8b477ac7e82ae.mp4?t=1755014136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799360/extras/56b892766460319e582dd7b0336e1c0d.poster.avif?t=1755014136\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799360/extras/56b892766460319e582dd7b0336e1c0d.webm?t=1755014136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799360/extras/56b892766460319e582dd7b0336e1c0d.mp4?t=1755014136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>iZolated</strong> is a post-apocalyptic world with procedurally generated locations affected by the Spoils, where in order to survive you have to create food, equipment, weapons and even build your own shelter from improvised items!<br><br>Travel through the procedurally generated forest, get resources, explore new locations, evolve to get out of the forest enveloped by the spoil.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799360/extras/f156c0b88e0724b4f9eaacefb2b88ba2.poster.avif?t=1755014136\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799360/extras/f156c0b88e0724b4f9eaacefb2b88ba2.webm?t=1755014136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799360/extras/f156c0b88e0724b4f9eaacefb2b88ba2.mp4?t=1755014136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Spoilage is a zombie virus that occurred due to scientists' experiments with plants, and this contagion spreads from the forest, infecting all living things with pollen. You will learn about the causes of the disaster and the consequences as you progress through the story of the game, will it lead to the final end for the world or is there a chance to survive?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799360/extras/74ef416e32b6be0dd69ac35f476a7c4a.poster.avif?t=1755014136\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799360/extras/74ef416e32b6be0dd69ac35f476a7c4a.webm?t=1755014136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799360/extras/74ef416e32b6be0dd69ac35f476a7c4a.mp4?t=1755014136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Game Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Character customization.<br></li><li>Semi-procedural world generation.<br></li><li>Weapon upgrades with special modifiers.<br></li><li>Crafting and Resource Extraction through hunting/fishing.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799360/extras/2c8841295fa65b285fb8b477ac7e82ae.poster.avif?t=1755014136\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799360/extras/2c8841295fa65b285fb8b477ac7e82ae.webm?t=1755014136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799360/extras/2c8841295fa65b285fb8b477ac7e82ae.mp4?t=1755014136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
